  {
   "day": 90,
   "line": "◈ THE TABLE — the ring of pale light flickers at the edge of the sky... and does not come. The System does not apologize this time. \"WE PRICED THE RUN. NO HUNGER ON THE RECORD — THE PELLET HUMS WHERE THE FIRE SHOULD BE. NO FEAST, NO SURGE, NOTHING HERE WE CAN PRICE. A COLD SPOT AT EVERY TABLE: THE WORDS WERE ON THE WRAPPER.\" The ledger still wants: wave-3 monsters faced. The mantle may pass to hungrier hands; the table will still be here."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "line": "👂 Overheard — Paola (to Jacob): \"Wanjiru's story has a fresh coat of paint.\" Paola taps the table. \"Scrape it off and you get a Wild food forager. Just don't scrape it in front of them.\""
  }
